{"post_id":33,"title":"Terms & Conditions","slug":"terms-conditions","status":"publish","elementor_data":[{"id":"b5e7b19","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"boxed","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"88","right":"64","bottom":"40","left":"64","isLinked":false},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":20,"column":"20","row":"20","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"a61aac3","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>POLICY</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":13},"typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":0.18}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"3cd2edd","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Terms & conditions","header_size":"h1","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":52},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.035},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.08}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"f5ea341","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Last updated [DATE]. By buying from this site you agree to these terms.</p>","text_color":"#8E8E93","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14},"typography_font_weight":"300"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"00fdfa8","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"boxed","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"64","bottom":"88","left":"64","isLinked":false},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":30,"column":"30","row":"30","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"a93bc5b","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Who we are","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"ba1d245","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>This site is operated by [YOUR REGISTERED BUSINESS NAME], registered at [YOUR REGISTERED BUSINESS ADDRESS], GSTIN [YOUR GSTIN]. Where these terms say we or us, that is who is meant.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"1cf869d","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Orders","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"c6b7c52","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Placing an order is an offer to buy, not a completed sale. The contract forms when we confirm dispatch. We may decline an order, and will tell you why and refund you in full if we do. Reasons include the piece being out of stock, a pricing error we spotted, or an address we cannot deliver to.</p><p>You must be 18 or older, or have the consent of a parent or guardian, to buy from this site.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"10fc6ce","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Prices and payment","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"dd2255f","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>All prices are in Indian Rupees and include GST. Shipping and any cash-on-delivery handling fee are shown separately at checkout before you confirm.</p><p>Prices can change without notice, but never after you have placed an order. If a price is obviously wrong because of a technical error, we will contact you before dispatch rather than silently cancelling.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"2adeca8","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"What the products are","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"116f787","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>These are handmade and small-batch goods in natural materials. Colour, grain, weight and finish vary between pieces, and screens render colour differently. We describe this variation honestly on each listing, and it is not a defect.</p><p>Care instructions are on each product page. Damage caused by ignoring them, such as soaking untreated wood, is not covered by our returns policy.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"2fc1cb9","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Delivery, returns and refunds","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"9868f40","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>These are covered in full by our Shipping &amp; Delivery and Returns &amp; Refunds pages, which form part of these terms.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"922816d","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Our content","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"9f12e83","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>The photographs, films, product descriptions and design on this site are ours. You are welcome to share links to them. You may not reuse the images or films commercially, or republish the text as your own, without our written permission.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"1affcd4","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Liability","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"9234e10","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Nothing in these terms limits your rights under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019, or any other law that cannot be excluded by agreement. Subject to that, our liability for any order is limited to the amount you paid for it.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"3797f85","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Disputes","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"54da281","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>These terms are governed by Indian law, and the courts at [YOUR CITY] have jurisdiction. Before anyone goes near a court, please write to <a href=\"mailto:support@wabisabivibe.store\">support@wabisabivibe.store</a> — almost everything is solvable that way.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}]}
